---
const features = [
  'Quote · Insight · Question · Action · Summary · Connection',
  '[[Wiki-links]] between notes, with backlinks generated automatically',
  'Page references, chapter markers, tags, image attachments',
  'Soft-deleted notes recoverable for thirty days',
];
---
<section class="px-6 py-20 md:py-28 max-w-6xl mx-auto border-t border-line">
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-16 items-center">
    <div class="md:order-2">
      <p class="font-sans text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-accent-deep uppercase">
        The editor
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink mt-3 leading-tight">
        Made for the way readers actually take notes.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-serif text-lg text-ink-muted mt-5 leading-relaxed">
        Drop a quote with attribution. Add a thought below it. Mark a question for later. Tag it for next month's revisit. The editor stays out of the way.
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
        {features.map((item) => (
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 font-serif text-base text-ink-soft">
            <span class="text-accent mt-2 text-[8px] leading-none">●</span>
            <span>{item}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="md:order-1">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-hero shadow-strong border border-line p-6 md:p-7 max-w-md mx-auto">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-ink-muted mb-4">
          Sapiens · Ch. 4
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-accent-deep bg-accent-pale px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              Insight
            </span>
            <p class="font-serif text-base text-ink mt-2 leading-relaxed">
              Agriculture didn't free humans — it bound us to wheat. The shift was a downgrade in lived quality, paid forward in raw population.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-4">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-sans font-bold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-accent-deep">
              Question
            </span>
            <p class="font-serif italic text-base text-ink-soft mt-1 leading-relaxed">
              What's the modern equivalent? What are we farming that's farming us back?
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-1">
            <span class="text-[10px] font-sans font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-ink-muted bg-paper px-2 py-1 rounded-full border border-line">
              HISTORY
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-sans font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-ink-muted bg-paper px-2 py-1 rounded-full border border-line">
              TRADE-OFFS
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
